				},
				"content": "<style>\n  @font-face {font-family: 'Quicksand';src: url(\"public/fonts/Quicksand.woff2\") format('woff2')}\n</style>\n<div style=\"color:#548343; font-weight:bold; background-color:#b8bb62;\">\n  &nbsp;PM10 levels and potential health problems\n</div>\n<div style=\"color:#548343; font-weight:normal;\">\n  PM10 is used when TBC... Most studies indicate the following <i>thresholds:</i><br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50f0e6;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&leq;54 µg/m³</b>: Good<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50ccaa;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;154 µg/m³</b>: Moderate<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#f0e641;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;254 µg/m³</b>: Unhealthy for sensitive individuals<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#ff5050;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;354 µg/m³</b>: Unhealthy<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#960032;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;424 µg/m³</b>: Very unhealthy<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#7d2181;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&GreaterEqual;425 µg/m³</b>: Hazardous<br>\n  <span style=\"color:#fbcb09;\">More info:</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/345329\" target=\"_blank\">World Health Organization (WHO) air quality guidelines (AQGs)</a></li>\n    </ul>\n</div>",
