				"content": "<style>\n  @font-face {font-family: 'Quicksand';src: url(\"public/fonts/Quicksand.woff2\") format('woff2')}\n</style>\n<div style=\"color:#548343; font-weight:bold; background-color:#b8bb62;\">\n  &nbsp;Total Formaldehyde and potential health problems\n</div>\n<div style=\"color:#548343;\">\n  Proposerd <i>thresholds in ppm</i> are:<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50f0e6;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&lt0.1 ppm</b>: Examples concentrations of formaldehyde: 0.0002-0.006 ppm (in rural and suburban outdoor air), 0.0015-0.047 ppm (in urban outdoor air), 0.020-4 ppm (in indoor air).<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50ccaa;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>0.1-0.5 ppm</b>: Nasal and eye irritation, neurological effects, increase risk of asthma and/or allergies.<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#f0e641;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>0.6-1.9 ppm</b>: Nasal and eye irritation, eczema, change in pulmonary function.<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#ff5050;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>2-5.9 ppm</b>: Nasal, eye and throat irritation, eczema or skin irritation, change in pulmonary function.<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#960032;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>6-10.9 ppm</b>: Nasal, eye, throat and skin irritation, headache, nausea, disconfort in breathing, cough.<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#7d2181;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;11 ppm</b>: (probably) nasal and eye irritation, nasal ulceration, change in pulmonary function, neurological effects, liver effects decreased body weight, decreased fetal weight, nasal tumors, reduced survival... bloody nasal discharge, pulmonary edema.<br>\n  Proposerd <i>thresholds in µg/m³</i> are:<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50f0e6;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&lt;15 µg/m³</b>: ????.<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#50ccaa;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>15-20 µg/m³</b>: ????<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#f0e641;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>21-25 µg/m³</b>: ????<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#ff5050;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>26-30 µg/m³</b>: ????<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#960032;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>31-35 µg/m³</b>: ????<br>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size:20px;color:#7d2181;\\\">&#9724;</span>&nbsp;<b>&gt;35 µg/m³</b>: ????<br>\n  <span style=\"color:#fbcb09;\">Ref: <a href='https://wwwn.cdc.gov/TSP/PHS/PHS.aspx?phsid=218&toxid=39' target=\"_blank\">US Agency for Toxic Substances and Disease Registry</a></span>\n</div>\n",
